1
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:05,870
(Penny:)You'll never believe
what happened to me at work.

2
00:00:06,072 --> 00:00:09,342
(Penny:)This old guy was choking on his food
and I saved his life.

3
00:00:09,542 --> 00:00:10,672
(Leonard:)Did you Heimlich him?

4
00:00:10,877 --> 00:00:13,277
(Penny:)No, I said,
"I think that old guy's choking."

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,680
Then one of the busboys Heimlich'd him.

6
00:00:17,717 --> 00:00:19,377
(Leonard:)You're a hero.

7
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:22,516
(Penny:)Yeah, that was the point of the story.

8
00:00:23,823 --> 00:00:26,253
(Leonard:)Do you know
if you have Thursday night off?

9
00:00:26,426 --> 00:00:27,826
Uh, I think so, why?

10
00:00:28,061 --> 00:00:29,791
(Leonard:)Why? It's Valentine's Day.

11
00:00:29,996 --> 00:00:32,426
(Penny:)Oh, right.
Yeah, we can do something.

12
00:00:33,566 --> 00:00:36,796
- You could be a little more into it.
- I'm into it, I'm into it.

13
00:00:37,003 --> 00:00:40,093
There's pressure to make the night special
and it never works out.

14
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:45,330
Well, this time it's gonna be different
because I'm like a romance ninja. Heh.

15
00:00:46,513 --> 00:00:49,713
You don't see it coming and then... Bam!
Romance! Watch out! Hearts, kisses, love!

16
00:00:49,883 --> 00:00:51,113
Ooh! Ya!

17
00:00:52,752 --> 00:00:55,512
(Penny:)Sometimes I think I've made you
cooler than you used to be...

18
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:56,912
(Penny:)...then you go
and do that.

19
00:00:59,692 --> 00:01:03,722
(Sheldon:)So in conclusion,
I believe the painful sensation felt...

20
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:06,900
(Sheldon:)...after passing a meal
of spicy chilies is proof...

21
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:10,870
(Sheldon:)...that the rectum does possess
the sense of taste.

22
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:20,615
(Amy:)I concur, but you changed the subject.
What are we doing for Valentine's Day?

23
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:25,020
(Sheldon:)Oh, you caught that, did you?

